WEBVTT

00:11:26.426 --> 00:11:30.898
we reject the nihilism of despair.

00:11:30.898 --> 00:11:34.131
We insist on faith in the future

00:11:34.131 --> 00:11:38.869
and in each other.

00:11:38.869 --> 00:11:42.370
Call this naive if you like.

00:11:42.370 --> 00:11:45.467
Call it impossibly idealistic if you must.

00:11:45.467 --> 00:11:47.895
But one thing is sure:

00:11:47.895 --> 00:11:51.361
Call it human.

00:11:51.361 --> 00:11:54.396
Could Muhammad have so radically changed his world

00:11:54.396 --> 00:11:57.248
without such faith, without the refusal

00:11:57.248 --> 00:12:01.964
to cede to the arrogance of closed-minded certainty?